# log/ — the agents' inbox for __PROJECT_NAME__

Agents write here freely: gotchas (`log/journal/YYYY-MM-DD-<slug>.md`, tag `gotcha`) and proposals
(`log/proposals/PROPOSAL - <what>.md`, title `PROPOSAL - <what>`, tag `proposal`, target `context/…` or a new
ADR). Durable content only; Basic Memory format; at least one relation to a `context/` note.
Humans triage weekly and promote into `context/` or `decisions/` (process: cairn
`log/README.md`). Never delete — set `status: promoted | rejected` on the proposal.

## Observations
- [rule] Agents write freely here; humans promote
- [rule] Proposal titles use `PROPOSAL - ` (dash, not colon: Windows filenames)

